<title>FRANCE: UAP shares soar at the open.</title>
<headline>UAP shares soar at the open.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in French insurer UAP opened 17.19 percent higher at 137 francs on Thursday, quoting for the first time since its announcement that it would merge with rival Axa</p>
<p>At 0914 GMT the stock was up 16.34 percent at 136 francs.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
</text>
